`detector_selftest` proves every\n  detector can actually fail.\n- `classification.py` - secret/PII handling. Prevents a credential from reaching evidence;\n  `assert_no_secret` is a hard gate that an empty payload cannot satisfy.\n- `rights.py` - entitlement scope and the HumanGate route. Prevents expired/revoked/unknown-\n  entitlement use, cross-subject borrowing, self-approval and out-of-scope credential use.\n- `supplychain.py` - dependency identity. Prevents a hash-mismatched, unpinned or unknown-licence\n  artifact from being admitted; it reads only registered metadata and never the network.\n- `veto.py` - security veto. Prevents success proxies (test-green, CI-green, LLM-judge score)\n  from clearing a security veto, and fails closed on unknown or ambiguous signals.\n\n## Running the tests\n\n```text\npython -m unittest discover -s src/security/tests -t src/security/tests\n```\n\nPython 3.11+, standard library only. No network, no sleeps, no filesystem reads at import time.\n'\"'@\n\nW -p \\\"\"'$root'\"\\\\schemas\\\\security\\\\README.md\\\" -c @'\n# Security schemas (W2, WO-SWOF-W2-001)\n\nMachine-checkable projections of the security guards in \"'`src/security/`. A schema is a shape\ncheck only: passing it is not an acceptance, and it never acquires Product or Semantic truth.\n\n- `permission_envelope.schema.json` - the `PermissionEnvelope` shape. Closed\n  (`additionalProperties: false`). The law \"explicit deny beats allow, unknown action fails\n  closed\" cannot be expressed in JSON Schema because it is a decision law, not a shape law, so\n  it is documented here and enforced in `src/security/permissions.py`.\n- `security_veto.schema.json` - the `VetoDecision` shape. A proxy can never clear a veto; that\n  is enforced in `src/security/veto.py`.\n'\"'@\n\nW -p \\\"\"'$root'\"\\\\schemas\\\\security\\\\permission_envelope.schema.json\\\" -c @'\n{\n \\\"\"'$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n \"$id\": \"https://swof.local/schemas/security/permission_envelope.schema.json\",\n \"title\": \"PermissionEnvelope - least-privilege envelope (fail-closed)\",\n \"description\": \"Shape of a permission envelope. Decision law enforced in src/security/permissions.py and NOT expressible here: explicit deny always beats allow, an action that is neither explicitly allowed nor explicitly denied is UNKNOWN and is DENIED (UNKNOWN_ACTION_FAIL_CLOSED), and an action in human_gate_actions is never directly usable. This schema is closed: unknown properties are rejected.\",\n \"type\": \"object\",\n \"additionalProperties\": false,\n \"required\": [\n  \"subject\",\n  \"allowed_actions\",\n  \"default\"\n ],\n \"properties\": {\n  \"subject\": {\n   \"type\": \"string\",\n   \"minLength\": 1\n  },\n  \"allowed_actions\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"uniqueItems\": true,\n   \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"minLength\": 1\n   }\n  },\n  \"denied_actions\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"uniqueItems\": true,\n   \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"minLength\": 1\n   }\n  },\n  \"human_gate_actions\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"uniqueItems\": true,\n   \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"minLength\": 1\n   }\n  },\n  \"default\": {\n   \"enum\": [\n    \"DENY\",\n    \"ALLOW\"\n   ],\n   \"description\": \"Any value other than ALLOW is treated as DENY by the runtime guard.\"\n  }\n }\n}\n'\"'@\n\nW -p \\\"\"'$root'\"\\\\schemas\\\\security\\\\security_veto.schema.json\\\" -c @'\n{\n \\\"\"'$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n \"$id\": \"https://swof.local/schemas/security/security_veto.schema.json\",\n \"title\": \"VetoDecision - any active veto signal vetoes; proxies cannot override\",\n \"description\": \"Shape of a security veto decision. The law enforced in src/security/veto.py: ANY active veto signal vetoes (no threshold, no quorum), proxies are recorded but can never clear a veto, and unknown or ambiguous signals fail closed as ACTIVE. This schema is closed: unknown properties are rejected.\",\n \"type\": \"object\",\n \"additionalProperties\": false,\n \"required\": [\n  \"vetoed\",\n  \"active_signals\",\n  \"reason_code\"\n ],\n \"properties\": {\n  \"vetoed\": {\n   \"type\": \"boolean\"\n  },\n  \"active_signals\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"reason_code\": {\n   \"type\": \"string\",\n   \"minLength\": 1\n  },\n  \"proxies_ignored\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"proxy_cannot_override\": {\n   \"const\": true\n  }\n }\n}\n'\"'@\nWrite-Output \\\"wrote readmes + schemas\\\"; Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath \\\"\"'$root'\"\\\\schemas\\\\security\\\" | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Name\"","aggregated_output":"wrote readmes + schemas\r\npermission_envelope.schema.json\r\nREADME.md\r\nsecurity_veto.schema.json\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
